{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016NHB5T74HWASL7W4V7M6K6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Perfect! I found the answer. Let me read the relevant section more carefully:\\\\n\\\\nBased on the file **`_intake/2026/02/16/mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md`**, this is a discussion thread about KIP-1274 regarding deprecating and removing support for the Classic rebalance protocol in KafkaConsumer.\\\\n\\\\nIn Lianet Magrans' response (lines 93-99), she states:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"About phase 1: I think the main goal at this point is to clearly communicate the recommendation in applications not using the new protocol. We can achieve that via an **info message** (and introduce the warn when we deprecate, as in the KIP), so agreed. Updated phase 1 with this.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nAnd this is further confirmed by Matthias J. Sax's earlier question (lines 119-126) where he questions whether WARN level is appropriate for Phase 1 and suggests INFO level would be better, to which Lianet agrees.\\\\n\\\\n**Answer:** The log level settled on for the initial release phase (Phase 1) was **INFO**.\\\\n\\\\n**Citation:** `/store/_intake/2026/02/16/mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md` (lines 93-99)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"_intake/2026/02/16/mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":23.26,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":4,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":99917,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":11789,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0425107,\\\"input_tokens\\\":66,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1775}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"babd98f5-c1a8-4394-80cb-010d0559b144","uuid":"97a9f4f4-16df-4f3f-a13c-009165fc15e8","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:45:39.403Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Perfect! I found the answer. Let me read the relevant section more carefully:\\\\n\\\\nBased on the file **`_intake/2026/02/16/mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-