o agreed. Updated phase 1 with this.\\\"\\n\\nAnd this is further confirmed by Matthias J. Sax's earlier question (lines 119-126) where he questions whether WARN level is appropriate for Phase 1 and suggests INFO level would be better, to which Lianet agrees.\\n\\n**Answer:** The log level settled on for the initial release phase (Phase 1) was **INFO**.\\n\\n**Citation:** `/store/_intake/2026/02/16/mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md` (lines 93-99)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"_intake/2026/02/16/mail-2b8888b66b964eada5234616-b9c0301d.md\"],\"seconds\":23.26,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":4,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":99917,\"cache_write_tokens\":11789,\"cost_usd\":0.0425107,\"input_tokens\":66,\"output_tokens\":1775}}"}}}
